# Data: downloads, extracted parquet and generated panels. Reproducible from
# `creditsurv ingest`; see docs/data_preparation.md.
#
# Unanchored so it catches a stray data/ directory at any depth -- a notebook run
# from notebooks/ creates its cache there, and an anchored rule silently let those
# parquet files into a commit. The package's own data module is excluded by name.
data/
!src/creditsurv/data/

